    "title": "Terry Black's Barbecue to open first San Antonio location Nov. 17 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "3 days ago\nSAN ANTONIO – Terry Black’s Barbecue, the Austin-founded Texas barbecue establishment, will open its first San Antonio restaurant to the public this month. The San Antonio restaurant will open to the public at 10:30 a.m. on Nov. 17 and is the chain’s eighth location, located at 2102 Broadway, near Pearl.\nRead full article\nAdd to Preferred Sources\n1",
